+"""Memory-only WinZip AES-256 codec; finite Linux child and strict ZIP records.
+
+AE-1/AE-2, stored/deflate, single-volume, non-ZIP64. Creation uses AE-2 and
+independent random salts. Names/metadata remain public. ZipCrypto and other
+encryption/compression profiles are explicitly unsupported. No extraction paths
+or passwords reach argv, environment, diagnostics, or filesystem writes.
+"""
